        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/k/9fc29f/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2012-05-23T01:36:05.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Just listened to the GMS Magazine podcast. Nice to hear from 2 designers on the same show. <img src=\"//forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/smiley.png?v=9\" title=\":smiley:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":smiley:\"></p>\n<p>But there were no spoilers. <img src=\"//forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/frowning.png?v=9\" title=\":frowning:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":frowning:\"></p>",
