        "id": 28030,
        "name": "Spiff",
        "username": "Spiff",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/spiff/{size}/1865_2.png",
        "created_at": "2012-05-23T03:56:09.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>There was a super tiny one. We knew that Gloomweaver’s minions try to bring him into our dimension by gathering three artifacts, but I hadn’t heard about how, if you kill the minions, they come back as zombies that are relatively harmless individually but are dangerous in groups, especially after GloomWeaver buffs them up.</p>",
