      {
        "id": 28031,
        "name": "Spiff",
        "username": "Spiff",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/spiff/{size}/1865_2.png",
        "created_at": "2012-05-29T18:59:26.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>You know what’s a long ways away?  August.  And now that the Kickstarter is over and the river of fun new reveals and content-ey type stuff has dried up, it’s going to be a long, parched summer.  But you know what would help deal with the burning trip through that desert?  Finding out what the new rules are for Vengeful Baron Blade and Cosmic Omnitron.  Since you don’t need a new deck to play those alt versions, they would be useful immediately.  Refreshingly, cooly satisfying and useful…</p>",
        "post_number": 425,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T02:01:58.530Z",
