        "created_at": "2012-05-29T19:15:21.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Yet again, I am inclined to agree with Spiff. I’m interested in a Baron Blade that actually poses a threat besides against 3 heroes on advanced. I really don’t like Omnitron that much, but it could be cool.</p>",
