        "created_at": "2012-05-30T14:19:36.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"&quot;&quot;Spiff&quot;&quot;\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n \"\"Spiff\"\":</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>You know what’s a long ways away?  August.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>T_T I KNOW. Do they offer cryogenic freeze for shorter periods yet?</p>\n<p>(The suggestion to reveal alternate Blade and Omnitron is nice, though I don’t have the base game yet, so now I’ll just go and look at card images and cry wistfully, like I do every day)</p>",
